           "Inside the tower is a room named the\n"
           "Battle Salon where you can meet\f"
           "other Trainers.\r"
           "There, you can find a Trainer to act\n"
           "as your partner in the Multi Battles.\r"
           "You can also partner up with a friend\n"
           "over wireless communications.\r"
           "Once you have partnered up, you will\n"
           "be shown to a Multi Battle Room.\r"
           "In the Multi Battle Room, seven\n"
           "tag teams await your challenge.\r"
           "If you manage to defeat all seven\n"
           "teams, you will earn Battle Points.\r"
           "If you want to interrupt your\n"
           "challenge, please save the game.\r"
           "If you don’t save, you will be\n"
           "disqualified from your challenge.\r"
           "Also, if you are on a tag team with\n"
           "a friend, you may not interrupt\f"
           "your challenge.\r")
    goto(_0BD4)
    end
